DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260801T220000
SUMMARY:V for Volleyball Watchung Res Aug1st from 1-9pm & BBQ!
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis And More\nI'm Mike 
 and my son is Michael. Join us as we play for fun initially\, then we'll k
 eep score. When we make teams\, we'll get a bit competitive where you must
  serve to score! Games will be to 25. No kicking\, no using your head.\n\n
 We'll have 2 Mikasa balls & 1 Wilson ball.\nWe have our own Volleyball NET
 \, poles\, & ropes!\nThere's a fire pit so we cook & have a barbecue.\nBri
 ng some snacks\, food\, or drinks or ice to share if you can.\nIf you have
  fun and would like to play with us at other locations\, join us!\n[V for 
 Volleyball New Jersey | Facebook](https://www.facebook.com/groups/15873146
 85975434)\nhttps://maps.app.goo.gl/w8ZFJhe6s4GBLF24A
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowling-soccer-volleybal
 l/events/315539270/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260704T002801Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260704T002801Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: NJ Bowling, Volleyball, Tennis & More
UID:event_315349152@meetup.com
